	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas, honorande et dilectissime frater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>6. iulii datas mature accepi ac indolui tanto <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tempore in vanum exultasse pios, cum per te <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>intelligo vana esse, quae pro compertissimis habita <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sunt de victoria <persName ref="p8315">Condensis</persName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Rursus ex eo consolationis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>aliquid accepi, quod pro certo nuncias <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>e literis illustrissimi principis ad <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunenses</placeName> scriptis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pacem iam forte esse compositam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Utinam ea <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sit pia, stabilis et iusta!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cum autem has <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>scribo, commonstrantur mihi literae allatae ex castris <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName>, qui sub <persName ref="p8354">Frölichio</persName> militant, ex quibus <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>intelligo dolo malo discessisse <persName ref="p20225">Guysium</persName> et pra<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>etendisse pacem, cum aliud conatus sit efficere, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>adeoque <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> vocari <placeName ref="l378">Lutetiam</placeName> mandarique, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut festinent.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quae si vera sunt, ut metuo, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>dominum oro, ut <persName ref="p8315">Condensi</persName> oculos aperiat videatque <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nihil penitus agendum esse cum versutis istis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>latronibus, nihil denique eis esse fidendum.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Uti<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nam tam diu non conduplicasset impensas <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et cunctatione opportunitatem neglexisset bonam!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Verum orabimus dominum, ut is rebus prope desperatis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>succurrat.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Accepi hodie literas ex <placeName ref="l98">Curia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>et <placeName ref="l93">Clavenna</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutat te d. <persName ref="p8093">Hercules a Salice</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sua<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dent et urgent viri boni ex <placeName ref="l648">Rhetia</placeName>, ut tibi di<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ligenter significem, dominis, imprimis vero illustrissimo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>principi et amiraldo significes, ne negligant <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName>, sed legatum mittant ad eos cum literis etc.; para<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tos <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>enim esse <placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName> mittere exercitum instructum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8009">Fabritius</persName> in haec verba ad me scribit: "Metuo, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>si nostri negligi se videant, ardor, quo incensi <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sunt in hac c[au]sa pro <persName>Codensi</persName>, abeat in indignationem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Facito tu, quod tibi optimum videtur."</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Scribit item <persName>Hercules Bononiae</persName> colligi militem <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>a papa, qui mittendus sit in <placeName>Provinciam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Monent <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>alii viri boni brevi a papa conscribend<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>a <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> 4000 ex papistis, et nominantur <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>aliquot duces, ac certum est ex <placeName ref="l2448">Immontanis</placeName> ali<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quot fuisse <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName> et iam rediisse domum <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>ac iactare <persName>Madrucium</persName>, <persName ref="p3730">Lazarum a Schwenden</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>et comitem ab <persName ref="p20295">Helffenstein</persName> collecturos militem <lb xml:id="p1z42"/><placeName ref="l822">Germanum</placeName> pro <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudo</placeName> contra <placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName> et <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Et huius generis multa commemorare possem, e[x] <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>quibus omnibus colligo moliri impios res ma<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>gnas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Tempestivum itaque esset, ut <persName ref="p8315">Condensis</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>cum suis etiam rebus suis et piorum prospiceret.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Spero te meas circa principium huius mensis de hisce re<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>bus scriptas te accepisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale una cum fratribus omnibus, <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>maxime <persName ref="p4440">Budaeo</persName> et <persName ref="p8078">Ionvilleo</persName>, et pergite <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>nobis diligenter et frequenter perscribere, quid <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> fiat; his enim bene uti possumus.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tig<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>uri</placeName> 17. iulii 1562.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te fratres.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta nobis <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> no<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>strum, qui unus per<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>iclitatur pro nobis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tu<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>us.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p540">Ioanni Calvino</persName>, <placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro, domino et fratri suo colendo et dilectissimo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l167">G[enf]f</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Cito.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
